# PoCP Network Architecture

## 12-Layer Architecture

```text
PoCP Capability Internet Protocol
│
├── 1. Entity Layer
├── 2. Node Layer
├── 3. Identity Layer
├── 4. Capability Layer
├── 5. Discovery Layer
├── 6. Invocation Layer
├── 7. Proof Layer
├── 8. Verification Layer
├── 9. Settlement Layer
├── 10. Reputation Graph Layer
├── 11. Governance Layer
└── 12. Protocol Economy Layer
```

## First Reference Application

PoCP AI Commons remains the first reference application.

It should evolve from:

```text
Contribution → Verification → CP → AI Credits
```

into:

```text
Entity → Capability → Invocation → Proof → Verification → Settlement → Reputation
```
